                    "body": "> Since this behavior is inconsistent with mini.files , should I consider this a bug to be patched in the future?\r\n\r\nYes, preview in both 'mini.files' and 'mini.pick' is probably reasonable to keep consistent. In which direction - that's the question. Probably reasonable for both to respect global values of 'list' and 'listchars'.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Since this behavior is inconsistent with mini.files , should I consider this a bug to be patched in the future?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, preview in both 'mini.files' and 'mini.pick' is probably reasonable to keep consistent. In which direction - that's the question. Probably reasonable for both to respect global values of 'list' and 'listchars'.</p>",
